<section class="m-sec">
  <div class="m-about">
    <img src="/assets/sanchitphoto.jpeg" alt="Sanchit Korgaonkar" width="120" height="120">
    <div class="m-about-txt">
      <p class="m-body">I've spent fifteen years making large programs land, from global payments launches at Mastercard to B2B SaaS. The pattern held everywhere: the constraint was rarely how fast people could build. It was how fast the organisation could decide, align and verify. AI made that gap impossible to ignore, so I started redesigning the layer where it lives.</p>
      <p class="m-small">Staff Technical Program Manager · Certified in AI Foundations and Strategy (Reforge)</p>
